have a physical response

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.930
whenever I think of it.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.510
- What is the best dessert
you've ever tasted?

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.500
- So depending on my mood, it's probably

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.510
devil's food cake.
- Mm.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.360
