00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.480
Cake and ice cream.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.850
Oh my God, it's so simple.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.330
- I feel like even this
conversation is off my diet.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.010
What is one tip to help people out there

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.090
who just wanna try it?

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.260
- Okay, okay, so it's not
an entirely sexy answer,

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.200
but getting a kitchen scale.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.520
It changes the entire game

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.270
because then everything
is always consistent.

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.380
It's actually less clean up.
- Mm hmm.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.490
- And everything just comes out better.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:07.390
