00:01:19.303 --> 00:01:21.800
You watch yourself.
Who isn't watching you?

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.693
Thank you, Zoe.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.840
Wow, you are tall. Okay.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:27.673
That's better.

00:01:27.673 --> 00:01:28.670
That's better.

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:31.000
I'm gonna ask you rapid fire
questions about house plants.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.470
- Bring it.
- How do you keep one alive?

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:33.500
'Cause I can't do it.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.230
- Well, I would say love, patience,

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.060
probably a bit of tenderness.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.290
You did say how do you keep
a relationship alive, right?

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.823
- Nope, just plants. But thank you.

00:01:42.823 --> 00:01:43.660
- Plants!
- That's all good takeaway

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.980
for relationships or plants.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.180
Should I be afraid of Venus fly traps?

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.320
Because I saw "Little Shop of
Horrors" and it scarred me.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.460
- Love "Little Shop of Horrors."

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.293
One of my favorite films.

00:01:52.293 --> 00:01:54.130
Unless you're a fly,

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.290
I don't think you need to be afraid.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:58.420
They help remove some of those gnats.

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.350
A lot of people have gnats
when they have house plants.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.760
They can remove those from
the environment in your home.

